- Dash0 OpenTelemetry skills (https://github.com/dash0hq/agent-skills), Apache-2.0.
- HashiCorp Terraform skills (https://github.com/hashicorp/agent-skills), MPL-2.0 (optional group iac).
- GitHub awesome-copilot skills (https://github.com/github/awesome-copilot), MIT: java-springboot, spring-boot-testing,
  java-junit, documentation-writer, github-actions-hardening, dependabot, threat-model-analyst, spring-security,
  spring-observability.
- Anthropic knowledge-work-plugins (https://github.com/anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins), Apache-2.0: architecture,
  system-design, incident-response; Anthropic skills (https://github.com/anthropics/skills): doc-coauthoring.
- Supabase agent skills (https://github.com/supabase/agent-skills), MIT: supabase-postgres-best-practices (group postgres).
